messages.text:
You're just one step away from
being able to challenge Burgh!{be01}
But, before that, I have to
try to stop you!{be01}

Burgh remodeled this Gym in order to
better understand the feelings Pokémon{be00}
that wrap themselves in cocoons have.{be01}
...Unfortunately, we can never seem to
find our way around as a result.
